# Flametongue Kavu: the trigger's source is the Kavu, and if it has left the battlefield by the time the trigger
# resolves the game uses its last-known information (CR 608.2h, 113.7a): it still deals 4 damage. Bot1 casts the Kavu on
# turn 3 targeting Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2), and with the trigger on the stack exiles its own Kavu with Swords to
# Plowshares (gaining its power, 4). The Ornithopter still takes 4 and dies; the Kavu is in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Black Lotus
Flametongue Kavu
Swords to Plowshares
Mountain x4
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
